  "definition": "Hearings on the Suspension or Revocation of a Tobacco Tax License",
  "effectiveDate": "2020-07-25",
  "historyNote": "#4060, eff 5-29-86; ss by #4510, eff 10-26-88; ss by #4706, eff 11-21-89; ss by #5389, eff 5-5-92, EXPIRED:5-5-98 New. #6749, eff 5-19-98 (from Rev 207.04), EXPIRED: 5-19-06 New. #8658-B, eff 6-13-06; ss by #9825-B, eff 11-25-10; ss by #11185-B, eff 9-20-16; amd by #13076-B, eff 7-25-20",
